{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173460/extras/20740fda41124d12aad834b976706b72.poster.avif?t=1771719923\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173460/extras/20740fda41124d12aad834b976706b72.webm?t=1771719923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173460/extras/20740fda41124d12aad834b976706b72.mp4?t=1771719923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes of the Living</strong> is a Survival Horror with fixed cameras inspired by the 90's greatest hits but with updated visuals and fully 3D environments with current gen graphics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>STORY</strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 1996, on a quiet small town located in Europe, a mysterious fog suddenly rises upon the town in a clear night, their inhabitants have no clue of the horrors and chaos that were about to unleash. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not longer after, the locals get sick and panic runs all over the place, nobody knows how or why the dead walks on the streets, a few hours later all left in the town are the <strong>echoes of the living\u2026</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173460/extras/9c2689268fe3292c8980da120b67a311.poster.avif?t=1771719923\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173460/extras/9c2689268fe3292c8980da120b67a311.webm?t=1771719923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173460/extras/9c2689268fe3292c8980da120b67a311.mp4?t=1771719923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>MEET THE CAST</strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laurel Reaves, </strong>a police officer faces the horror from the beginning, her goal is to investigate the fate of her father with the help of<strong> Marcus Wallace </strong>and escape the infection<strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Liam Oakwood, </strong>an ex Special Forces member arrives to the town where he was about to move in and start a new life with his fianc\u00e9e<strong> Octavia Blade, </strong>he couldn\u2019t imagine that this would be in the worst moment, his goal is to find his fianc\u00e9e and together leave behind the horror.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonists are tied up in the hell on earth the city has become, they have to collaborate to discover what\u2019s going on and make it out alive.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173460/extras/36c28e728ddd2d1673c74389bb19c127.poster.avif?t=1771719923\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173460/extras/36c28e728ddd2d1673c74389bb19c127.webm?t=1771719923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173460/extras/36c28e728ddd2d1673c74389bb19c127.mp4?t=1771719923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></u> <br><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7</strong> Fixed Camera Angles </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7</strong> Classic Tank Control (The best experience the game was designed for)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7 </strong>Puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7 </strong>Limited inventory management</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7</strong> Backtracking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7</strong> Save Room and Item Storage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7</strong> Multiple stories with their own point of view</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7 </strong>All types of enemies from blood thirsty zombies, mutated fauna to other nightmare fuel creatures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7 </strong>Fully 3D environments with current gen graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Walk over dark and bloody streets, shady exteriors, emblematic buildings such as the Hospital, Art Gallery, the City Hall, the Theatre\u2026 and try to find out what\u2019s going on</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7</strong> Wide arsenal to adapt to your playstyle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7</strong> Weapon and equipment upgrades to reward the player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7 </strong>In game unlockables </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7</strong> Immersive OST inspired by the Classics </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173460/extras/ff5a75b555ac16e584aeb9e3a1831ce5.poster.avif?t=1771719923\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173460/extras/ff5a75b555ac16e584aeb9e3a1831ce5.webm?t=1771719923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173460/extras/ff5a75b555ac16e584aeb9e3a1831ce5.mp4?t=1771719923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>ABOUT US</strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are a young couple that following our passion left everything to work full time on the development of this game, we want to bring back memories from the 90s to modern times</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173460/extras/baea9b5dc91d5734359051c3b8590c93.poster.avif?t=1771719923\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173460/extras/baea9b5dc91d5734359051c3b8590c93.webm?t=1771719923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2173460/extras/baea9b5dc91d5734359051c3b8590c93.mp4?t=1771719923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to Alba City","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2173460/cafd9e64f2b748cc2f3fac7e09e5d93deded974b.jpg"},{"name":"Feathered friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2173460/b24e00ab328837b213c3340494b534582af1d650.jpg"},{"name":"The first one is always special","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2173460/e53df178ed53a0922d4d56e29dfa1ccddbd246c4.jpg"},{"name":"The curiosity killed the cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2173460/b9bdbb0b33e951e3ec7238c615335e232b9efc9a.jpg"},{"name":"The beginning of a long night","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2173460/8f804a2ae14d509f6f4eeffcd1a84900b12fc976.jpg"},{"name":"Where's my checkpoint?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamst